---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Received"
  description="The note is in the review queue at The American Forge. It is not on the site."
  noindex
>
  <p class="crumb">
    <a href="/">Manufacturers</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
    <a href="/submit">A review or a correction</a>
    <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
    <span>Received</span>
  </p>
  <div class="page-intro">
    <p class="eyebrow">In the queue</p>
    <h1>Received</h1>
    <p class="lede">It is not on the site.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="stack">
    <p class="prose">
      A person at The American Forge reads the queue before a record changes. An edit that holds up is applied in the repository. An edit that does not hold up leaves the page as it is. A review request is read the same way and is not published from the form. A company suggestion does not put that company on the list.
    </p>
    <p class="prose">
      <a href="/">Back to the list</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
      <a href="/submit">Send a correction</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
      <a href="/submit/review">Request a review</a>
      <span aria-hidden="true"> · </span>
      <a href="/submit/company">Suggest a company</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
